    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not just \"stress\" though. i've tried the therapist thing, the breathing exercises, all that. it feels like there's just a core part of me that's decayed. like a machine with parts that are just gone. you can't fix something if the parts aren't even there anymore. it just feels like a waste of energy to keep trying to patch up something that's already ruined. don don u think think it s possible just be",
